    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00838",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“嗯，没意思，那玩意儿。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Well, that thing is no fun.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00838",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "来，来，该你下啦。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Come on, come on, it is your turn.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00838",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我走这儿了。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I am playing here.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00838",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "纸商说着指了指棋盘。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The paper merchant said this and pointed at the game board.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00838",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "他已经沉醉在胜负之中，我却心不在焉。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He was already absorbed in the match, but my mind was elsewhere.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00838",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "艺人们好像要回去，那汉子从院子里扬声喊了一句：“晚上好！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The entertainers seemed about to leave, and the man called out from the courtyard, \"Good evening!\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
